<title>UK: Soybean carrier runs aground near Hamburg.</title>
<headline>Soybean carrier runs aground near Hamburg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Liberia-flag bulker Yorkgate sustained engine trouble and ran aground near Hamburg on Friday, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence said.</p>
<p>The 38,377-dwt vessel is bound for Germany from Baltimore with a cargo of soybeans.</p>
